OL,3,AAfD candidate elected speaker of German
OL,4,Aregional parliament for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FA month after Germany's far-right AfD
OL,7,Fscored a decisive victory in the
OL,8,Feastern state of Saxony-Anhalt, the
OL,9,Fparty's candidate Tobias Rausch has
OL,10,Fbeen elected as parliament speaker
OL,11,Fthere too.
OL,13,FNot since World War Two has a far-right
OL,14,Fparty secured the post of speaker, and
OL,15,Fprotesters outside the building in
OL,16,FMagdeburg held up banners saying,
OL,17,F"Never again is now".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
