OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAfD candidate elected speaker of German
OL,4,Aregional parliament for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough the AfD fell three seats short
OL,7,Fof a majority in last month's election,
OL,8,FRausch, 35, comfortably won Tuesday's
OL,9,Fvote with the support of 9 MPs from
OL,10,Fother parties.
OL,12,F"The days of political firewalls should
OL,13,Fbe a thing of the past," Rausch said
OL,14,Fafter the vote, rejecting a post-war
OL,15,Fconsensus in German politics not to
OL,16,Fwork with the far right.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
